    <img class="cover-cut" src="/assets/img/hero-cut.webp" width="1122" height="1402" alt="Reggie James in a navy blazer and open-neck shirt, arms folded" fetchpriority="high">
  </div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="hero-roles">Business adviser<i aria-hidden="true"></i>Operator<i aria-hidden="true"></i>Investor perspective</p>
      <h1>The right decisions change everything.</h1>
      <p class="hero-kicker">I help business leaders make them.</p>
      <p class="sub">I have spent 25 years building technology businesses, developing markets, winning customers and leading teams. Today I work directly with founders, CEOs and investors to solve difficult commercial problems, find better opportunities for growth and turn decisions into action.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a class="pill" href="#contact">Let's talk about your business</a>
        <a class="pill ghost-d" href="#story">Explore my experience</a>
      </div>
