      <div class="fig"><b>$23<small>M</small></b><p><strong>ARR, up from $8m</strong>Software client growth supported over three years.</p></div>
      <div class="fig"><b>88<small>%</small></b><p><strong>EMEA revenue growth</strong>in 12 months for an enterprise software client, with cost per acquisition down 37.6%.</p></div>
      <div class="fig"><b>200<small>+</small></b><p><strong>Clients</strong>including Adobe, Xerox and Bentley Systems, across the UK, Europe, the US and Asia.</p></div>
